Optimism Compound V3 Fork Deposit

GIVEN the Optimism child Compound v3 adapter
  WHEN a caller other than the vault deposits
    THEN it reverts
  WHEN the vault deposits USDC
    THEN the adapter supplies to live Compound v3 and TVL increases
  WHEN the vault deposits one USDC base unit into an empty position
    THEN supply succeeds even though the credited value rounds to zero
    AND a subsequent normal deposit succeeds
